stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED : AccountCreatedEvent<br/>initialBalance > 0
    CREATED --> ACTIVATED : AccountActivatedEvent<br/>emitted immediately after creation

    ACTIVATED --> ACTIVATED : AccountCreditedEvent<br/>balance = balance + amount
    ACTIVATED --> ACTIVATED : AccountDebitedEvent<br/>amount > 0 and balance >= amount

    ACTIVATED --> SUSPENDED : UpdateAccountStatusCommand
    ACTIVATED --> BLOCKED : UpdateAccountStatusCommand
    SUSPENDED --> ACTIVATED : UpdateAccountStatusCommand
    SUSPENDED --> BLOCKED : UpdateAccountStatusCommand
    BLOCKED --> ACTIVATED : UpdateAccountStatusCommand
    BLOCKED --> SUSPENDED : UpdateAccountStatusCommand

    note right of ACTIVATED
        Credit and debit commands require
        an ACTIVATED aggregate.
    end note

    note right of CREATED
        The controller generates the UUID.
        The aggregate is reconstructed from
        events before every later command.
    end note
